<title>USA: Bio-Plexus names Krampert CEO.</title>
<headline>Bio-Plexus names Krampert CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TOLLAND, Conn. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Plexus Inc, named Larry Krampert chief executive officer effective August 1.</p>
<p>Ron Haverl will step down from the chief executive officer post but will remain chairman.</p>
<p>&quot;I am pleased with the appointment of Larry Krampert,&quot; said Haverl. &quot;The last nine years have been a period of building for Bio-Plexus...I believe Larry has the skill, experience, and energy to take the company to the next phase of market and financial growth.&quot;</p>
<p>Krampert served in a number of executive positions at Johnson &amp; Johnson.</p>
</text>
